  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.11 Alternative monitoring system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.11 “Alternative monitoring system” means a system or component of a system, designed to provide direct or indirect data of mass emissions per time period, pollutant concentrations, or volumetric flow, as provided for in this chapter.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
